<Slide>
  <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1120', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    {/* A 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderBottom: '2px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3)' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>第 4 章 · 动作组</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>loop_action：多组循环执行器</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* B 内容区：左代码 + 右说明 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 600 }}>
        <CodeBlock
          code={`void loop_action(void)
{
    static long long systick_ms_bak = 0;
    if (group_do_ok == 0) {           // 正在播放
      if (SysTick_get_ms()-systick_ms_bak > action_time) {
        systick_ms_bak = SysTick_get_ms();
        if (group_num_times!=0 && do_time==0) {
            group_do_ok = 1;          // 播完
            Usartprintf(USART_DEBUG,"@GroupDone!");
            return;
        }
        do_group_once(do_start_index);// 播当前组
        if (do_start_index == group_num_end) {
            do_start_index = group_num_start; // 回到起点
            if (group_num_times != 0) do_time--; // 一轮完成
        } else {
            if (group_num_start < group_num_end)
                do_start_index++;     // 正序前进
            else do_start_index--;    // 倒序后退
        }
      }
    }
}`}
          language='c'
          width={600}
          fontSize={13}
        />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>由 $DGT:x-y,z! 触发</span>：把 start/end/times 写进全局变量，令 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>group_do_ok=0</span>，本函数每轮播一组。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>间隔控制</span>：每组之间等 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>action_time</span>（由 getMaxTime 算出的本组最大 T），保证动作衔接顺滑。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,191,36,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', borderLeft: '4px solid #FBBF24' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            ✅ 已修复：旧逻辑用 `do_start_index==end` 的死代码，多组播放会漏末组、重复首组。现改为「播到 end 才回起点并 do_time--」，正/倒序都完整。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* C 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>六轴机械臂代码详解</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>29 / 41</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
